    feat(compact): add OAI-format compaction and round grouping
    
    Task 4: Add OAI-native variants for compaction pipeline:
    - compactStaleRoundsOai(): truncate tool message content in stale rounds
    - microCompactOai(): lightweight round-safe truncation for OAI format
    - groupIntoRoundsOai(): round detection using tool_calls/tool_call_id
    - runResumePreflightOai(): detect and repair orphan tool_calls
    - detectOrphanToolCallsOai(): find tool_calls without matching results
    - detectOrphanToolResultsOai(): find results without matching calls
    
